    ,                             !- Minimum Air Flow Fraction Schedule Name
    Flow/Area,                    !- Outdoor Air Method
    ,                             !- Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Person
    0.000508,                     !- Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Zone Floor Area {m3/s-m2}  Source: xlsx Zone and HVAC System Summary Q48 (Total OSA Ventilation, 20 cfm/person) x N48 (Design Occupancy Density, 5.000 people per 1000 ft2) = 0.1000 cfm/ft2 = 0.000508 m3/s-m2 (1 cfm/ft2 = 0.00508 m3/s-m2).
    ,                             !- Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Zone
    HotWater;                     !- Reheat Coil Type  Source: xlsx HVAC System Type 7 (reheat with hot water): HVAC System Type Dictionary row 9; Zone and HVAC System Summary column G row 48.

