  HVACTemplate:Zone:WaterToAirHeatPump,
    DataCenter_bot_ZN_6,          !- Zone Name  Source: xlsx raw_data!I239 HVAC System Name = AIRLOOP DATACENTER BOT. xlsx HVAC System Type 14.
    OfficeThermostat,             !- Template Thermostat Name
    ,                             !- Cooling Supply Air Flow Rate
    ,                             !- Heating Supply Air Flow Rate
    ,                             !- No Load Supply Air Flow Rate
    ,                             !- Zone Heating Sizing Factor
    ,                             !- Zone Cooling Sizing Factor
    Flow/Zone,                    !- Outdoor Air Method
    ,                             !- Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Person
    ,                             !- Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Zone Floor Area
    0.0184,                       !- Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Zone {m3/s}  Source: xlsx raw_data!P239 Total OSA Ventilation = 0.0184 m3/s.
    ,                             !- System Availability Schedule Name  Empty: always on (the xlsx HVAC schedule is an office-hours schedule; a data center is cooled all day, without it the zone overheats at night)
    AlwaysOn;                     !- Supply Fan Operating Mode Schedule Name  Source: xlsx HVAC System Type 14 (Fan Control = Constant volume: the fan runs continuously): HVAC System Type Dictionary row 16; Zone and HVAC System Summary column G row 55.

