    AlwaysOn;                     !- Supply Fan Operating Mode Schedule Name  Source: xlsx HVAC System Type 14 (Fan Control = Constant volume: the fan runs continuously): HVAC System Type Dictionary row 16; Zone and HVAC System Summary column G row 57.

